#. Tag: title
#: plugins.docbook:949 plugins.docbook:1859 plugins.docbook:2043
#: plugins.docbook:2268
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Inföhren"

#. Tag: para
#: plugins.docbook:950
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kappname;'s Search &amp; Replace plugin allows you to search for text or "
"<ulink url=\"help:katepart/regular-expressions.html\">regular expressions</"
"ulink> in many different files at once. You can search all open files, all "
"the files in one directory and optionally its subdirectories, or all files "
"in the current project. You can even filter by filename, for instance "
"searching only files that end with a particular file extension."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: plugins.docbook:960 plugins.docbook:1338
#, no-c-format
msgid "Interface"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: plugins.docbook:963
#, no-c-format
msgid "Search Query"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: plugins.docbook:965
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The following options are always displayed at the top of the Search in Files "
"tool view:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guiicon
#: plugins.docbook:971
#, no-c-format
msgid "New Tab"
msgstr "Nieg Paneel"

#. Tag: para
#: plugins.docbook:972
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can have as many searches as you want open at the same time. Simply "
"click the <guibutton>New Tab</guibutton> button at the top-left corner of "
"the Search tool view and a new results tab will open permitting you to "
"perform another search."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guiicon
#: plugins.docbook:981
#, no-c-format
msgid "Toggle Results"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: plugins.docbook:982
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The down arrow in the top right-corner of the Search in Files tool view will "
"toggle the bottom half of the tool view between displaying additional "
"options for the Search in Folder mode and the results of your search."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: plugins.docbook:990
#, no-c-format
msgid "Find"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: plugins.docbook:991
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is where you type in what you want to find. You may enter standard "
"text, or a regular expression if enabled."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: plugins.docbook:998
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Replace</guilabel> (text box)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: plugins.docbook:999
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Replacement text that will be added to file(s) in place of the text in the "
"<guilabel>Find</guilabel> text box."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guibutton
#: plugins.docbook:1006
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>Search</guibutton>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: plugins.docbook:1007
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you've finished configuring everything, just press the "
"<guibutton>Search</guibutton> button to perform your search. You may also "
"press &Enter; in the <guilabel>Find</guilabel> text box to do the same."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guibutton
#: plugins.docbook:1015
#, no-c-format
msgid "Replace"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: plugins.docbook:1016
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you've finished configuring everything, just press the "
"<guibutton>Replace</guibutton> button to replace the text entered in the "
"<guilabel>Find</guilabel> text box with that of the <guilabel>Replace</"
"guilabel> text box. You may also press &Enter; in the <guilabel>Replace</"
"guilabel> text box to do the same."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guibutton
#: plugins.docbook:1026
#, no-c-format
msgid "Next"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: plugins.docbook:1027
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Go to the next match of your search query, switching files if necessary."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guibutton
#: plugins.docbook:1033
#, no-c-format
msgid "Replace checked"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: plugins.docbook:1034
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The same as <guibutton>Replace</guibutton>, but will only perform "
"replacements in files that are checked in the pane below."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: plugins.docbook:1044
#, no-c-format
msgid "Search in Folder Options"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: plugins.docbook:1046
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These options are displayed below the aforementioned query options. If "
"search results are being displayed instead, press the <guiicon>Toggle "
"Results</guiicon> button to display them."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: plugins.docbook:1053
#, no-c-format
msgid "Match case"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: plugins.docbook:1054
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Restricts search results to only those that have the exact same combination "
"of upper and lower case letters as your search query."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: plugins.docbook:1061
#, no-c-format
msgid "Regular expressions"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: plugins.docbook:1062
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Permits you to use <ulink url=\"help:katepart/regular-expressions.html"
"\">regular expressions</ulink> instead of simple text as your search query."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: plugins.docbook:1069
#, no-c-format
msgid "Expand results"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: plugins.docbook:1070
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Display all the results found in each file, instead of just a list of files "
"that contain the search query."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: plugins.docbook:1077
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Search</guilabel>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: plugins.docbook:1078
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This has three options. Select <guilabel>in Open files</guilabel> to search "
"all files currently open in &kappname;. Select <guilabel>in Folder</"
"guilabel> to search inside a folder and optionally its subfolders. Select "
"<guilabel>in Project</guilabel> to search all the files listed in the "
"currently open project."
